"(invariancia parcial) vía "
"semTools::partialInvariance()/partialInvarianceCat()."

#: R/measurementinvariance.b.R
msgid ""
"{model} invariance is supported by only one of the two criteria -- treat "
"this level with real caution rather than as settled. Investigate partial "
"invariance to see whether the discordance traces to specific items before "
"relying on comparisons that require this level."
msgstr ""
