#: R/advancedreliability.b.R
msgid ""
"{n} item(s) load negatively on their own factor: {items}. This usually means "
"the item needs reverse-scoring (recoding it so higher raw values mean more "
"of the construct) before re-running this analysis, not that it should be "
"dropped."
msgstr ""
"{n} ítem(s) cargan negativamente sobre su propio factor: {items}. Esto "
"usualmente significa que el ítem necesita recodificación inversa (para que "
"valores brutos más altos signifiquen más del constructo) antes de volver a "
"correr este análisis, no que deba eliminarse."

#: R/advancedreliability.b.R
