#: R/fiabilitylibrary.b.R
msgid ""
"Welcome to FiabilityLab. <b>Reliability</b> is the consistency of a measure: "
"an instrument is reliable if it produces similar results under consistent "
"conditions. FiabilityLab covers three main designs — <b>internal "
"consistency</b> (one instrument, one administration), <b>inter-rater "
"agreement</b> (multiple raters, one occasion), and <b>temporal stability</b> "
"(one instrument, repeated occasions; planned)."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido a FiabilityLab. La <b>confiabilidad</b> es la consistencia de una "
"medida: un instrumento es confiable si produce resultados similares bajo "
"condiciones consistentes. FiabilityLab cubre tres diseños principales — "
"<b>consistencia interna</b> (un instrumento, una administración), <b>acuerdo "
"entre jueces</b> (varios jueces, una ocasión), y <b>estabilidad temporal</b> "
"(un instrumento, ocasiones repetidas; planificado)."

